OL,3,GNEWSA'I took my pony to McDonald's and
OL,4,Ahe was lovin' it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFast food staff were left shocked and
OL,7,Fconfused when a man on a pony turned up
OL,8,Fat a McDonald's drive-thru.
OL,10,FEventing horse rider, Nick Holden,
OL,11,Fposted a reel on his Instagram feed
OL,12,Fdocumenting his journey to the branch
OL,13,Fin Wychbold, Worcestershire, atop his
OL,14,Fblack and white steed, Sparky.
OL,16,FIt has since been viewed more than
OL,17,F590,000 times and received hundreds of
OL,18,Fcomments, with many describing the
OL,19,Fpair's adventure as "awesome".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
