OL,3,GNEWSA'I took my pony to McDonald's and
OL,4,Ahe was lovin' it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolden, from Feckenham, revealed he did
OL,7,Fthe same journey on horseback about 10
OL,8,Fyears ago, when he could not drive.
